#: templates/sentry/emails/requests/organization-project.html:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"  %(requester_name)s told us you’d be interested in Sentry App Monitoring for Mobile.\n"
"  "
msgstr "\n%(requester_name)s 请告诉我们您对Sentry的移动应用监控感兴趣"

#: templates/sentry/emails/requests/organization-project.html:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Why? Well, because Sentry for Mobile shows a holistic overview of your application's health in real-time. So you can correlate errors with releases, tags, and devices to solve problems quickly, decrease churn, and improve user retention.\n"
"  "
msgstr "\n  为什么？好吧，因为移动端的 Sentry 实时显示你的应用程序运行状况的整体概览。所以你可以将错误与发行版本、标签和设备关联起来以快速解决问题，减少客户流失，并提高客户留存。\n  "

#: templates/sentry/emails/requests/organization-project.html:20
msgid ""
"\n"
"    <strong>See</strong> session data, version adoption, and user impact by every release.\n"
"    "
msgstr "\n    <strong>查看</strong>每个版本的会话数据、版本使用情况和对用户的影响。\n    "

#: templates/sentry/emails/requests/organization-project.html:25
msgid ""
"\n"
"    <strong>Solve</strong> issues quickly with full context: contextualized stack traces, events that lead to the error, client, hardware information and the very commit that introduced the error.\n"
"    "
msgstr "\n    带着完整的上下文快速的<strong>解决</strong> 问题：上下文化的堆栈跟踪信息，导致了错误的那些事件，客户端，硬件信息和引入错误的具体 commit。\n    "

#: templates/sentry/emails/requests/organization-project.html:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"    <strong>Learn</strong> and analyze event data to reduce regressions and ultimately improve user adoption and engagement.\n"
"    "
msgstr "\n    <strong>学习</strong>并分析事件数据以减少问题的回归，并最终改善用户接受度和参与度。\n    "

#: templates/sentry/emails/requests/organization-project.html:36
msgid ""
"\n"
"    And guess what? Set up takes less than five minutes.\n"
"    "
msgstr "\n    而且您猜怎么着？搭起来还不用五分钟。\n    "

#: templates/sentry/emails/requests/organization-project.html:41
