"\n"
"                No need to waste time committing these to memory. After you authenticate the app,\n"
"                we'll give you one last nudge via your private channels.\n"
"                "
msgstr "\n无需浪费时间记住这些。验证app后，\n我们将通过您的私人渠道给您最后一次提醒。"

