#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:94
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升级"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:97
msgid "Farewell to Slack's legacy workspace apps."
msgstr "告别 Slack 的传统工作区应用程序。"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:99
msgid ""
"The time has come, Slack's deprecated its workspace apps. And with it, goes "
"our legacy Slack integration."
msgstr "时机已到，Slack 已弃用其工作区应用程序。 随之而来的是我们传统的 Slack 集成。"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:102
msgid ""
"But don't worry, we built you a whole new Sentry-Slack integration. Just "
"authorize the app, and then you can get back to doing whatever it is you "
"came here to do."
msgstr "但别担心，我们为您打造了一个全新的 Sentry-Slack 集成。 只需授权该应用程序，然后您就可以重新开始做您来到这里要做的任何事情。"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:105
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Want to know more about the move? We wrote you some <a href=\"https://docs.sentry.io/product/integrations/slack/#upgrading-slack\">docs</a>.\n"
"        "
msgstr "\n想了解更多关于该变化的信息吗？我们为您编写了一些<a href=\"https://docs.sentry.io/product/integrations/slack/#upgrading-slack\">文档</a>"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:110
msgid "Your existing alert rules may need some love."
msgstr "您可能需要关注一下现有的警报规则。"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:112
msgid ""
"If you don't have private channels in your alert rules, just authorize our "
"new Slack app and then you can get on with your life."
msgstr "如果你的警报规则中没有私人频道，只需授权我们新的 Slack 应用，然后就可以继续你的生活。"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:115
msgid ""
"\n"
"        If you <strong>do</strong> have private channels being used in your alert rules, bear with us. You've got an extra step to go.\n"
"        "
msgstr "\n如果你在警报规则中<strong>确实</strong>使用了私有频道，请耐心等待。你还需完成一个额外步骤。\n"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:120
msgid ""
"\n"
"        How do you know which channels are used in alert rules? We'll tell you. Our next step audits your configuration to identify\n"
"        which channels need some post-authentication love. Bear in mind that if you've got a lot of Slack channels with alert rules,\n"
"        this might take a hot minute.\n"
"        "
msgstr "\n你怎么知道哪些频道被用于警报规则？我们来告诉你。下一步会审计你的配置，找出\n哪些频道需要一些认证后的处理。请注意，如果你有很多带警报规则的Slack频道，\n这可能需要一会儿。\n"

