#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/analyzeFrames.tsx:20
msgid ""
"File I/O operations, such as reading from or writing to files on disk, can "
"be time-consuming, especially if the file size is large or the storage "
"medium is slow. Move File I/O off the main thread to avoid this ANR."
msgstr "文件I/O操作（例如从磁盘读取或写入文件）可能非常耗时，尤其是在文件较大或存储介质较慢时。请将文件I/O移出主线程，以避免此ANR。"

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/analyzeFrames.tsx:25
msgid ""
"Database operations, such as querying, inserting, updating, or deleting "
"data, can involve disk I/O, processing, and potentially long-running "
"operations. Move database operations off the main thread to avoid this ANR."
msgstr "数据库操作，如查询、插入、更新或删除数据，可能涉及磁盘I/O、处理，以及可能的长运行操作。将数据库操作从主线程移除以避免此ANR。"

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/analyzeFrames.tsx:30
msgid ""
"If you have a particularly large or complex SharedPreferences file or if "
"you're performing multiple simultaneous commits in quick succession, this "
"can lead to ANR. Switch to SharedPreferences.apply or move commit to a "
"background thread to avoid this ANR."
msgstr "如果您有一个特别大或复杂的SharedPreferences文件，或者您正在快速连续执行多个同时提交，这可能会导致ANR。切换到SharedPreferences.apply或将提交移动到后台线程以避免此ANR。"

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/analyzeFrames.tsx:35
msgid ""
"SharedPreferences.apply will save data on background thread only if it "
"happens before the activity/service finishes. Switch to "
"SharedPreferences.commit and move commit to a background thread."
msgstr "SharedPreferences.apply将在活动/服务完成之前在后台线程上保存数据。切换到SharedPreferences.commit，并将提交操作移动到后台线程。"

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/analyzeFrames.tsx:40
msgid ""
"The app is initializing too many things on the main thread during app "
"launch. To avoid this ANR, optimize cold/warm app starts by offloading "
"operations off the main thread and [link:lazily initializing] components."
msgstr "应用在启动时于主线程上初始化了太多内容。为避免此ANR，请通过将操作移出主线程并[link:延迟初始化]组件来优化冷启动/热启动。"

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/analyzeFrames.tsx:47
msgid ""
"If the AssetManager operation involves reading or loading a large asset file"
" on the main thread, this can lead to ANR. Move loading heavy assets off the"
" main thread to avoid this ANR."
msgstr "如果AssetManager操作涉及在主线程上读取或加载大型资源文件，可能会导致ANR。请将加载大型资源的操作移出主线程，以避免此ANR。"

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/analyzeFrames.tsx:52
msgid ""
"If you're reading a particularly large raw file (for example, a video file) "
"on the main thread, this can lead to ANR. Look for heavy resources in the "
"'/res' or '/res/raw; folders to avoid this ANR."
msgstr "如果你在主线程上读取特别大的原始文件（例如视频文件），可能会导致ANR。请检查 '/res' 或 '/res/raw' 文件夹中的大体积资源，以避免此ANR。"

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/analyzeFrames.tsx:57
msgid ""
"The app is potentially inflating a heavy, deeply-nested layout. "
"[link:Optimize view hierarchy], use view stubs, use include/merge tags for "
"reusing inflated views to avoid this ANR."
msgstr "应用可能在加载一个庞大、深层嵌套的布局。[link:优化视图层级]、使用ViewStub、并使用include/merge标签复用已加载的视图，以避免此ANR。"

