#: static/app/gettingStartedDocs/dotnet/awslambda.tsx:78
msgid ""
"[code:FlushOnCompletedRequest] ensures all events are flushed out. This is "
"because the general ASP.NET Core hooks for when the process is exiting are "
"not guaranteed to run in a serverless environment. This setting ensures that"
" no event is lost if AWS recycles the process."
msgstr "[code:FlushOnCompletedRequest] 确保所有事件都被刷新。这是因为在无服务器环境中，进程退出时通用的 ASP.NET Core 钩子不保证会运行。此设置可确保在 AWS 回收进程时不会丢失任何事件。"

