#: static/app/gettingStartedDocs/go/echo.tsx:143
msgid ""
"[sentryEchoCode:sentryecho] attaches an instance of "
"[sentryHubLink:*sentry.Hub] to the [echoContextCode:echo.Context], which "
"makes it available throughout the rest of the request's lifetime. You can "
"access it by using the "
"[getHubFromContextCode:sentryecho.GetHubFromContext()] method on the context"
" itself in any of your proceeding middleware and routes. And it should be "
"used instead of the global [captureMessageCode:sentry.CaptureMessage], "
"[captureExceptionCode:sentry.CaptureException] or any other calls, as it "
"keeps the separation of data between the requests."
msgstr "[sentryEchoCode:sentryecho] 会将 [sentryHubLink:*sentry.Hub] 的实例附加到 [echoContextCode:echo.Context]，使其在整个请求的剩余生命周期内都可用。你可以在后续的任何中间件和路由中，通过上下文本身的 [getHubFromContextCode:sentryecho.GetHubFromContext()] 方法访问它。应使用它来代替全局的 [captureMessageCode:sentry.CaptureMessage]、[captureExceptionCode:sentry.CaptureException] 或任何其他调用，因为它能保持请求之间的数据隔离。"

#: static/app/gettingStartedDocs/go/echo.tsx:153
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that [sentryHubCode:*sentry.Hub] won't be available in "
"middleware attached before [sentryEchoCode:sentryecho]!"
msgstr "请记住，[sentryHubCode:*sentry.Hub] 在 [sentryEchoCode:sentryecho] 之前附加的中间件中不可用！"

