#: static/app/utils/issueTypeConfig/performanceConfig.tsx:54
msgid ""
"Consecutive DB Queries are a sequence of database spans where one or more "
"have been identified as parallelizable, or in other words, spans that may be"
" shifted to the start of the sequence. This often occurs when a db query "
"performs no filtering on the data, for example a query without a WHERE "
"clause. To learn more about how to fix consecutive DB queries, check out "
"these resources:"
msgstr "连续数据库查询是一系列数据库跨度，其中一个或多个已被标识为可并行化的跨度，换句话说，可以移动到序列开头的跨度。当数据库查询不对数据执行过滤时，例如没有WHERE子句的查询，通常会发生这种情况。要了解有关如何修复连续数据库查询的更多信息，请查看以下资源："

