#: static/app/views/performance/vitalDetail/utils.tsx:111
msgid ""
"First Contentful Paint (FCP) measures the amount of time the first content "
"takes to render in the viewport. Like FP, this could also show up in any "
"form from the document object model (DOM), such as images, SVGs, or text "
"blocks. At the moment, there is support for FCP in the following browsers:"
msgstr "First Contentful Paint（FCP）测量第一个内容在视口中渲染所需的时间。与FP一样，这也可以以文档对象模型（DOM）的任何形式展示，如图像、SVG或文本块。目前，以下浏览器支持FCP："

#: static/app/views/performance/vitalDetail/utils.tsx:112
msgid ""
"Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) is the sum of individual layout shift scores "
"for every unexpected element shift during the rendering process. Imagine "
"navigating to an article and trying to click a link before the page finishes"
" loading. Before your cursor even gets there, the link may have shifted down"
" due to an image rendering. Rather than using duration for this Web Vital, "
"the CLS score represents the degree of disruptive and visually unstable "
"shifts. At the moment, there is support for CLS in the following browsers:"
msgstr "累积布局偏移(CLS)是渲染过程中每个意外元素偏移的单个布局偏移分数的总和。想象一下，在页面加载完成之前，导航到一篇文章并试图点击一个链接。在您的光标到达之前，链接可能已经由于图像渲染而向下移动了。CLS分数代表了破坏性和视觉不稳定变化的程度，而不是用持续时间来衡量这个网络的重要性。目前，以下浏览器支持CLS:"

#: static/app/views/performance/vitalDetail/utils.tsx:113
msgid ""
"First Input Delay (FID) measures the response time when the user tries to "
"interact with the viewport. Actions maybe include clicking a button, link or"
" other custom Javascript controller. It is key in helping the user determine"
" if a page is usable or not. At the moment, there is support for FID in the "
"following browsers:"
msgstr "首次输入延迟（FID）衡量用户尝试与视口交互时的响应时间。操作可能包括点击按钮、链接或其他自定义Javascript控制器。它对于帮助用户判断页面是否可用至关重要。目前，以下浏览器支持FID："

#: static/app/views/performance/vitalDetail/utils.tsx:114
msgid ""
"Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) measures the render time for the largest "
"content to appear in the viewport. This may be in any form from the document"
" object model (DOM), such as images, SVGs, or text blocks. It’s the largest "
"pixel area in the viewport, thus most visually defining. LCP helps "
"developers understand how long it takes to see the main content on the page."
" At the moment, there is support for LCP in the following browsers:"
msgstr "最大内容绘制(LCP)​​ 用于测量视口中最大内容元素的渲染时间。该内容可以是文档对象模型(DOM)中的任意元素，如图像、SVG或文本块。作为视口中占据最大像素区域的内容，它最能直观体现页面加载性能。LCP指标可帮助开发者了解页面主要内容呈现所需时长。目前支持LCP指标的浏览器包括："

#: static/app/views/performance/vitalDetail/utils.tsx:115
msgid ""
"Time to First Byte (TTFB) is a foundational metric for measuring connection "
"setup time and web server responsiveness in both the lab and the field. It "
"helps identify when a web server is too slow to respond to requests. In the "
"case of navigation requests—that is, requests for an HTML document—it "
"precedes every other meaningful loading performance metric. At the moment, "
"there is support for TTFB in the following browsers:"
msgstr "首字节时间（TTFB）是测量实验室和现场连接设置时间和web服务器响应性的基本指标。它有助于识别web服务器何时响应请求太慢。在导航请求的情况下，即对HTML文档的请求，它先于其他所有有意义的加载性能指标。目前，以下浏览器支持TTFB："

