msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/csp.tsx:77
msgid ""
"[link:Content Security Policy]\n"
"            (CSP) is a security standard which helps prevent cross-site scripting (XSS),\n"
"            clickjacking and other code injection attacks resulting from execution of\n"
"            malicious content in the trusted web page context. It's enforced by browser\n"
"            vendors, and Sentry supports capturing CSP violations using the standard\n"
"            reporting hooks."
msgstr "[link:内容安全政策]\n(CSP)是一个安全标准，用于防止由于在可信网页上下文中执行恶意内容而导致的跨站脚本（XSS）、点击注入和其他代码注入攻击。它由浏览器供应商实施，Sentry支持使用标准报告钩子捕获CSP违规行为。"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/csp.tsx:88
msgid ""
"To configure [csp:CSP] reports\n"
"              in Sentry, you'll need to send a header from your server describing your\n"
"              policy, as well specifying the authenticated Sentry endpoint."
msgstr "在Sentry中配置[csp:CSP]报告，您需要从您的服务器发送一个头部来描述您的策略，同时指定认证过的Sentry端。"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/csp.tsx:96
#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/hpkp.tsx:71
msgid ""
"For example, in Python you might achieve this via a simple web middleware"
msgstr "例如，在Python中您可以通过一个web中间件来实现"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/expectCt.tsx:40
msgid "Certificate Transparency (Expect-CT)"
msgstr "证书透明度（Expect-CT）"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/expectCt.tsx:51
msgid ""
"[link:Certificate Transparency]\n"
"      (CT) is a security standard which helps track and identify valid certificates, allowing identification of maliciously issued certificates"
msgstr "[link:证书透明度]\n(CT)是一个用于追踪和验证证书有效性的安全标准，可以识别恶意颁发的证书"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/expectCt.tsx:57
