#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/hpkp.tsx:43
msgid "HTTP Public Key Pinning (HPKP)"
msgstr "HTTP公钥固定(HPKP)"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/hpkp.tsx:44
msgid "HTTP Public Key Pinning"
msgstr "HTTP公钥固定"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/hpkp.tsx:55
msgid ""
"[link:HTTP Public Key Pinning]\n"
"              (HPKP) is a security feature that tells a web client to associate a specific\n"
"              cryptographic public key with a certain web server to decrease the risk of MITM\n"
"              attacks with forged certificates. It's enforced by browser vendors, and Sentry\n"
"              supports capturing violations using the standard reporting hooks."
msgstr "[link:HTTP公钥固定]\n（HPKP）是一项安全功能，它告诉Web客户端将特定的加密公钥与特定的Web服务器相关联，以降低使用伪造证书进行MITM攻击的风险。它由浏览器供应商实施，Sentry支持使用标准报告钩子捕获违规行为。"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/hpkp.tsx:65
msgid ""
"To configure HPKP reports\n"
"              in Sentry, you'll need to send a header from your server describing your\n"
"              policy, as well specifying the authenticated Sentry endpoint."
msgstr "为了在Sentry中配置HPKP报告，您需要从服务器发送一个头部来表述你的策略，同时指定认证过的Sentry端。"

#: static/app/views/settings/projectSecurityHeaders/hpkp.tsx:76
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can setup HPKP reports to simply send reports rather than\n"
"              actually enforcing the policy"
msgstr "或者，您可以将HPKP报告设置为仅发送报告，而不实际执行策略"

